 "name_en": "Advanced Payment Management (4MT)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Advanced Payment Management (4MT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio3d6453b313bd44f7a5dd43d34fe9c9c9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3d6453b313bd44f7a5dd43d34fe9c9c9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Advanced Payment Management supports the monitoring and approval of payments for both SAP systems and non-SAP systems. In the overall process, there’s a seamless integration with cash management. The conversion of various payment formats is also supported (for example, converting CSV or TXT files to XML).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3d6453b313bd44f7a5dd43d34fe9c9c9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve payment batch file</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve payment batch</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process payment batch</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3d6453b313bd44f7a5dd43d34fe9c9c9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide a single source of truth for payment approval and monitoring for SAP and non-SAP systems</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase the level of automation along the entire end-to-end process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase transactional throughput of payments in an environment where payment volumes are significantly increasing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Handle formats centrally</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>高级付款管理 (4MT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio3d6453b313bd44f7a5dd43d34fe9c9c9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3d6453b313bd44f7a5dd43d34fe9c9c9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">高级付款管理支持 SAP 系统和非 SAP 系统的付款监控和审批。在整个流程中，与现金管理无缝集成。还支持各种付款格式的转换（例如，将 CSV 或 TXT 文件转换为 XML）。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3d6453b313bd44f7a5dd43d34fe9c9c9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">批准付款批次文件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">批准付款批次</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理付款批次</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3d6453b313bd44f7a5dd43d34fe9c9c9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为 SAP 和非 SAP 系统的付款审批和监控提供单一事实来源</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高整个端到端流程的自动化水平。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在付款量显著增加的环境中，提高付款的交易吞吐量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">集中处理格式</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
